{ "Identifier":       { "ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "MMC-MAD-V2.5-I01", "AIMName": "MMC-MAD-V2.5" },

  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "Multimodal Anonymous Dialogue: the HCI middleware Module for anonymous multimodal dialogue (no identity - no ID Reconciliation). A trusted composite exposing the north HCI API to a User Agent application. It recognises the human's speech (Automatic Speech Recognition), processes the dialogue turn (Entity Dialogue Processing, a local LLM) into the Machine's response Text and Personal Status, and renders that response (Response and Scene Rendering) into the Machine Speech and Machine Face Descriptors. A running dialogue Summary threads across turns (Summary in, EditedSummary out) so the dialogue keeps context. This implementation is the ASR + EDP + RSR slice; Personal Status Extraction and Natural Language Understanding are the next processing SubAIMs.",

